{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-7","storyName":"死结两端","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"通过分销紧缺的能源，弑君者与圣骏堡的工人们建立了联系。为了与能源的供应方保持联络，弑君者决定寻找新的通讯设备，而偶然遇见的古米正好给她提供了线索。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["弑君者","？？？","凛冬","被捕的工人","远处的声音","热情的工人","古米","坚雷"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_bg_bg_towerinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"animtext","id":10,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>圣骏堡，罗德岛临时办事处</><p=2>冬季舞会一周前</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"animtextclean","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":15,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"坚雷女士，我来提交近期的报告——","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......坚雷女士？","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","fadeout":"true","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_heavyobject_putdown","volume":"0.7","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":22},{"type":"text","text":"眼前只有一片混乱，看不出任何有人的踪迹。弑君者开始把面前的纸箱搬开，试图给自己清出一条道路来。","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"怎么还是这么乱......完全没地方下脚。","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"坚雷——","id":25},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.5","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是谁在外面？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"坚雷教官不在，报告可以给我。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"啊，是你。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"坚雷女士呢？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"不知道，我也刚从外面回来没几天，现在办事处里只有我和拉达——就是古米，只有我们俩在。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"正式建立办事处的事刚定下来，其他人大概在到处跑手续。我马上也要出去一趟，有份学联的稿件要争取在这几天发出去——","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我的报告在这，麻烦你转交一下。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......行。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":53},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":54},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"等等。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"还有什么事？","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"呃......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"虽然你看上去好像不愿意跟我们说话，总是独来独往，但大家都是乌萨斯人，如今又都是罗德岛的干员。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"现在新建办事处，什么都要从头开始，我想，也许我们可以互相帮助，提高点效率。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......你们需要什么？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#6$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"不是！我是想说，如果你有什么需要，是可以向办事处、向我们寻求帮助的，懂吗？没必要什么事都自己扛着。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"当然，如果我们需要，也会找你的。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"教官说你除了定期递交报告之外，和办事处的人没有任何交集，虽然我觉得各司其职也不错，但你刚好来了，我就说一声。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"你不会希望我频繁出现在这里的。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"别擅自决定我的想法。我知道你和切城，甚至和整合运动有关系，但你到底干了什么，我不知道，也暂时不打算去了解。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"对我们来说那是个会反复开裂的伤口，可什么都躲着也不会让它真正长合。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"更重要的是，你和我们站在一起，现在又正是缺人的时候，这就够了。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"所以，如果你需要帮助，不要忘了告诉我们。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":87},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#5$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"喂！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"谢谢。","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"如果需要，我会的。","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"charslot","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_bg_72_g1_sjbstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":101},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"animtext","id":104,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>圣骏堡，学院滨河街道警察分局</><p=2>12月24日 7:45 A.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":105},{"type":"animtextclean","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"柳德米拉！","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......我正想去保释你。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"那就感谢有人做好事，又给咱们省了一笔保释金吧！","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"你是怎么被放出来的？刚才的爆炸声又是......","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"——都逃跑——","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"远处的声音","text":"快追——！","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"圣骏堡嘛，这种事不稀奇。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"还是先别说了，要是站这等那些草包警察过来，我就又得进去蹲着了。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......先别回去，跟我走。我还有事要问你。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_bg_bg_oldwarehouse_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"你怎么知道我被条子带走了？我还以为自己要在那蹲坑蹲到天荒地老呢。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"有人看到你被警察问话，住在你对面的那个小孩，记得吗？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"小孩？红头发的那个？我只记得他看上去阴恻恻的，有点讨人厌——","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"不要以貌取人。你手上的货都卖完了吗？","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"还有一个人没跟我碰头，被抓走之前我就是在等他。奥多耶夫区的那个......叫什么来着？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"鲁斯，理发师，住在第五大道，他家里有两个刚出生的孩子，妻子死于流感并发症。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"对......对，是他。除了他之外，其他人我都已经交接好了。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"能量转换器的钱他们都是怎么付的？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"啊？不是不用付钱吗？只要持续找我们买货，能量转换器就算送给他们了。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"没错。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"......原来你在考我！我有这么不可靠吗？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"可靠的人一般不会让自己被抓进拘留所里。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"别提了，聊事儿，聊事儿！","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"你在担心我或者其他人背着你用能量转换器赚差价吗？","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"不会的，现在大家都服你了，全靠你，我们才没被冻死，大伙谢谢你还来不及呢——","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"不，我理解你们中有的人想多赚些钱的理由，但方法不该是去剥削比自己生活得更困难的人，这不是我选择分销时想看到的。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我有其他渠道，却选择和你们分销而不是独自经营，这样做是徒增风险，你们应该明白。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"说真的，我到现在都不懂你为什么要做这么吃力不讨好的事......宁愿自己吃亏，也要给其他人提供便利。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"鲁斯那边我已经交接好了，但之后招揽新客户的事需要暂停一段时间，有消息我再通知你。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"啊？那我们这段时间的供应会被断掉吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"之前的储备还能支撑现有用户的需要，大概能维持两周左右，在这期间，我会想办法接上货源。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"如果有新客户找上门来，小心辨认，用我给你的那些钱，能帮的话就帮一下，但不要告诉他们供应链的问题，以免引起恐慌。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"我当然是相信你的......有什么我能帮你的吗？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"不用，这是我的责任。接下来我可能会出城几天，如果有人问起我的动向，你替我应付一下。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"谢谢。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被捕的工人","text":"这个好说，但如果真有什么事，我该怎么联系你？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"还是来这里，给我留封信，像我之前教你们的那样。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_72_g15_wideunder.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的工人","text":"柳德米拉！好久没在下面看到你了，是要出城去吗？","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"嗯，有点事。前面哪个出口现在没人守着？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的工人","text":"都有，不过他们看到是你，肯定不会拦着的。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"最近没有可疑的人试图从动力层进来，对吧？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的工人","text":"没有，警察巡逻得也少了，如果你问的是哪个出口没有警察，答案是一样的。他们只在固定的时间过来，多数时候都是咱们自己看着。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"好，谢谢你。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的工人","text":"早点回来啊！","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":213,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......应该是这儿......","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"弑君者蹲下身，抹去地上的积灰，一道用刀锋凿出来的印记逐渐清晰。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"抬头望去，一模一样的应急逃生梯被整齐地安装在各级结构之间。她攀上其中一架逃生梯，来到动力层的更深处。","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_climbmetalladder","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_bg_29_g3_cottage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"能听见吗？","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"喂？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":237},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_square_common","char":"？？？","switch":"true","style":"1","size":"400, 720","offset":"300,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你那边安全吗？","id":241},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"这是新的安全屋，已经确认过没有窃听器和监控摄像头。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"好，我时间有限......","id":247},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......你还好吗？","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":251},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不太好，但这不重要。我们偷偷往圣骏堡转移能源这件事很可能已经被发现了，我暂时还没有受到处罚......","id":253},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":257},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他们已经翻新了通讯基站，很可能下一步是新建能源管道，然后将原来的那条废弃。在这之前，我们必须做好两手准备。","id":259},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"你还打算继续在要新建的管道上做手脚？","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":263},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不是打算，而是必须。","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"原本的管道就已经算得上是萨列夫格勒区特供的了，现在他们大概想把新管道定向铺设至皇宫，连其他的贵族也不管了。","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"说是为了“节省资源”，可不断新建不知道什么时候就会被天灾摧毁的管道就不是一种浪费了吗？","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我听说这边已经有工人被抽调走了，圣骏堡没有任何相关消息吗？","id":268},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"没有，圣骏堡本身......有它的问题。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":272},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你是指之前提到过的那些学生——","id":274},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"就算矿脉枯竭的消息没能被封锁，你们正在研究的东西还是给了议会拖延的时间。加上第四集团军前不久也面临了自己内部的动乱......","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"贵族、军队、工人，这里暂时都没人轻举妄动，除了对这些背后的暗涌一无所知的学生。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":279},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":281},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"啊，我不是在指责你。只是，如果你能告诉我更多关于你们正在研究的项目——","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":285},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"先说正事吧。在新管道建成之前，原先的那条应该还会继续使用，只是我们的通讯方式必须得更换了。","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我记得你现在用的通讯装置，连的是外国公司的独立线路？","id":288},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"是的，租用了乌萨斯境内外资公司的通讯基站。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":292},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这就是问题。就算是外资公司，只要基站在乌萨斯境内，就还是可能会受到严密监控，在远北“广播”事件之后更是如此。","id":294},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"每次都更换匿名通讯频道也不行吗？","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":298},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"现在这边的通讯基站被翻新了，很难说会不会加了什么新功能。你能找到独立搭建线路的无线电通讯设备吗？不经过商用基站的那种？","id":300},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"就像是，更精密的、稀有的军用级设备？那可能需要花点时间。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":304},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"试试吧，试试。如果你找到了，可以继续用这个频道尝试联络我。","id":306},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"如果没有......那恐怕就只能等我找到机会，再主动联络你了。要是两周之后我还没有消息，你就销毁所有和我联络过的痕迹。","id":308},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......我们都先想想办法吧。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"保重。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":313},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是啊，保重。","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","id":317},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"false","id":318},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsduration":"0.5","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","id":319},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_bg_21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"animtext","id":329,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>圣骏堡，罗德岛临时办事处</><p=2>冬季舞会数日后</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":330},{"type":"animtextclean","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":332},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":333,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1","duration":"1","id":334},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"真的真的不能出去帮忙吗？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"烈夏姐留下一封信就走了，真理姐她们也没怎么回过办事处，难道她们不需要我的帮助吗？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"凛冬姐是为了我才被抓走的，可我什么也做不到——","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#10$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"古米，我理解你的担忧，但在下一批驻守干员抵达圣骏堡之前，必须有人留在这里，帮忙处理办事处业务。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"新建感染者收治中心、协助政府进行感染者登记和管理，还有很多事等着我们去做呢。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#7$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"而且，这些也是让正在外面奔走，或暂时陷入困境的她们，没有后顾之忧的重要任务！","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"这些都很重要，我明白。可如果我唯独在救凛冬姐这件事上帮不上忙......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#7$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我不想这样。那天要不是我出了状况，凛冬姐也不会被抓走！","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#10$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"我理解你的心情，小熊，但我也答应了真理她们要保护——","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"凛冬在吗？","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#8$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"欸？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"凛冬姐被警察抓走了——咦，弑君者小姐！","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......可以直接叫我柳德米拉。你说凛冬被警察抓走了是什么意思？","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":365},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":373,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......该死。我该早几天过来的。你们知道她现在在哪儿吗？我能帮什么忙？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"凛冬在封锁区，救她的事我们已经在想办法了。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"封锁区？卡托加区？那地方基本已经是巴普洛维奇的独立王国了，你们——罗德岛在这其中能做什么？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"......","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#10$1","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"是乌萨斯学生自治团......是这些孩子们，自己在想办法救自己的同伴。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"可我没有帮上忙！凛冬姐是因为我才被抓进去的，我却什么也做不了......","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"你们确定凛冬目前被关在封锁区里？","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"早露通过多方查证，确认了这点。她也已经通过某种渠道见过那位巴普洛维奇大人。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"但她也没办法把凛冬救出来......或者说，是凛冬自己不想走。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"凛冬姐不想出来？","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#8$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"你为什么这么说——","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/ED/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......直觉。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"办事处有没有更新型号的通讯器？独立搭建线路的那种，不走商用通讯基站。这几天我找了很多渠道，连黑市都没人出售。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#9$1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"这种东西听起来是只有各国军方，或者可露希尔那种喜欢自己瞎鼓捣的家伙才会有的。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"除非特别申请，不然普通办事处一般都没有这种级别的配置。你要做什么？","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"救人。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"早露说封锁区实行通讯静默，就算有这种通讯器也没用。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"（低声）不，这是为了联系帮我偷电的人。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我和那个人的联络很可能已经被发现了，需要换个更安全的方式。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#2$1","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"偷——","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"偷电？！","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"嘘。","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#2$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"......最近城里出现的便宜能源，原来是你在运作。","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"还有很多人在帮忙。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#3$1","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"好吧，我不该这么惊讶的。你比我们早到乌萨斯，中央区的情报网络也是你搭起来的，能做到这种事也不奇怪。","id":422,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"既然办事处没有我要的通讯器，那我就先走了。你们保护好自己，凛冬那边我也会想办法的。","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_260_durnar_1#7$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚雷","text":"你也小心，可别被发现了。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_260_durnar_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"（小声）通讯器......通讯器？","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"什么？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我想起来了！","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我们在舞会那天用过的窃听器，就是有个学生自己做的，凛冬姐说她还有一整套自己搭建的无线电通讯设备——","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#4$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"这个学生现在在哪儿？","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"......我不知道。东西是凛冬姐借到的，可能只有她才知道那个人在哪儿了。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"bgeffect","id":442},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":443},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":444},{"type":"image","id":445},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":446}],"characters":["弑君者","？？？","凛冬","被捕的工人","远处的声音","热情的工人","古米","坚雷"]}